<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 3.0130.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 3.0130.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0130 against the dollar, down from 2.9995 on Friday and at 1.8295 to the mark, up from 1.8380, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The central bank's fixing was 2.40 percent from the weighted average dollar and mark parity rates, slightly stronger than Friday's 2.36 percent fix.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
